     Version V1.03B

     This is a bug fix version for V1.03

     The Areafix in V1.03 was a bit buggy.


    -The help text had a large number in de %PAUSE line, because
     %P was seen as a code to show a pointer instead of just text.

    -The PAUSE and RESUME code put a point (.) for the
     name of the fix file name.

    -When RESUMEing it now deletes the .fix file.

    -There was an error in the resume code, while reading
     area names from disk in came in a loop where it couldn't
     get out of.

    -While pausing it now gives a list of the area names it pauses

